# A long `##1' chain (caliptra fv_ecc_pm_sequencer: one property of 1040
# steps) was parsed left-deep, one AST level per step: the simplifier ran out
# of stack (macOS) or stopped at its depth guard ("has no declaration"), and
# sva2check's sequence walk aborted past 200 levels ("RUNAWAY seq_end").
# Past 128 steps the parser rebuilds the chain as a balanced tree of the same
# operands (concatenation is associative).
